@startuml class_diagram
!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12

title Frequencies Editor - Class Diagram (post-migration)

class Frequency {
    +frequency: number
    +frequencyTypeId: Guid
}

class FrequenciesEditorComponent {
    +frequencyTypes: InputSignal<FrequencyType[]>
    +frequencies: InputSignal<Frequency[]>
    -_local: Frequency[]
    +rows: get => Frequency[]
    +columns: DataTableColumn<Frequency>[]
    +deleteTpl: TemplateRef
    +handleFrequencySave($event): void
    +remove($event): void
}

class FrequencyType {
    +frequencyTypeId: Guid
    +name: string
}

class DataTableComponent<T>

FrequenciesEditorComponent --> Frequency : composes
FrequenciesEditorComponent --> FrequencyType : selects from
FrequenciesEditorComponent --> DataTableComponent : renders

note right of FrequenciesEditorComponent
  In-memory composition only.
  Persistence happens in the
  outer dialog on Save.
end note

@enduml
